{"accountName": "Moonlight Bug Hunter", "author": "Moonlight Bug Hunter", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 XiaoC 2023-05-05 19:00 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Powershell 加载 shellcode", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bPGqVWskPLictgqUGxzyk5slITTTGu5aAmSLbfeGH9qsC5P0mKdksa6xZtt4gMj02OL63tVnSKahHPYvBcb62ibA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "说 powerful 是最近发现它能运行时加载 machine code，且是运行在 linux 上的 powershell，即使 linux powershell 已经被封印了一部分能力（访问 win native）。本文讨论的 powershell 仅指 6/7，6 以前是另一个东西，不在此讨论。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "测试环境", "type": "h"}, {"text": "ubuntu20/macos big sur", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bPGqVWskPLictgqUGxzyk5slITTTGu5aAibdK6K9J1nk6CNIpuLgibLnvszFt9ABCTcDaGib0yzYYXosndYWltn0LQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "dotnet --version", "type": "p"}, {"text": "7.0.203", "type": "p"}, {"text": "pwsh --version", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PowerShell 7.3.4", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Psl2Csharp", "type": "h"}, {"text": "Add-Type", "type": "p"}, {"text": "测试 hello world", "type": "p"}, {"text": "这种方式比反射调用 static 那种，每次只能调用一个方法方便地多，其中的 .net 代码段和运行在 .net core 上的无异，可替换为任意 todo，方便移植。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Csharp2C", "type": "h"}, {"text": "execve", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ls -al", "type": "p"}, {"text": "这段代码是 chatgpt 生成的，比较简单，没啥可说。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Csharp2Asm", "type": "h"}, {"text": "配合 linux 加载内存的方式，不调用  exec", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ls -al", "type": "p"}, {"text": "最终代码是 chatgpt 生成的，我给了它一个 c 版本的作为输入，所以它实际上是做了一个 translation。还是帮了不少忙，不然我得一个个对着两边的文档去翻译。小瑕疵是不够 readable，懒得 prompt 了。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "mprotect", "type": "p"}, {"text": "shellcode", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PROT_READ | PROT_WRITE | PROT_EXEC", "type": "p"}, {"text": "linux 不允许像 windows 那样直接用 api 去改另一个进程的 memory map", "type": "p"}, {"text": "shellcode 是手敲之后，用  https://defuse.ca/online-x86-assembler.htm  转的，顺便复习了汇编，快10年没写这玩意儿了，边敲边感慨丹尼斯·里奇的伟大", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".section .text", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".global _start", "type": "p"}, {"text": "_start:", "type": "p"}, {"text": "xorq %rdx,%rdx # param3", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push %rdx", "type": "p"}, {"text": "movq $0x616c2d,%r8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push %r8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "movq $0x736c2f6e69622f,%r8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push %r8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "mov %rsp, %rdi # param1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push %rdx", "type": "p"}, {"text": "lea 8 (%rdi), %rcx", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push %rcx", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push %rdi", "type": "p"}, {"text": "mov %rsp, %rsi # param2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push $0x3b", "type": "p"}, {"text": "pop %rax", "type": "p"}, {"text": "syscall", "type": "p"}, {"text": "xorq %rdi, %rdi", "type": "p"}, {"text": "push $0x3c", "type": "p"}, {"text": "pop %rax", "type": "p"}, {"text": "syscall", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Psl2Asm", "type": "h"}, {"text": "把前面每步的效果串起来，最终实现 powershell invoke asm", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他", "type": "h"}, {"text": "powershell 是跨平台的，osx 也可以，略微有些区别，直接把官网代码改吧改吧就能跑", "type": "p"}, {"text": "参考", "type": "h"}, {"text": "https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/mmap.2.html", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/mprotect.2.html", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/memcpy.3.html", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/native-interop/pinvoke", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bPGqVWskPLictgqUGxzyk5slITTTGu5aAmSLbfeGH9qsC5P0mKdksa6xZtt4gMj02OL63tVnSKahHPYvBcb62ibA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "5月5日", "id": "3975706420", "summary": "原创 XiaoC 2023-05-05 19:00 北京 \nLinux Powershell 加载 shellcode\n说 powerful 是最近发现它能运行时加载 machine code，且是运行在 linux 上的 powershell，即使 linux powershell 已经被封印了一部分能力（访问 win native）。本文讨论的 powershell 仅指 6/7，6 以前是另", "title": "Powerful PowerShell For Linux", "ts": 1683284400000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5Mzk3NTE0Mw==&mid=2247483695&idx=1&sn=1391bcd424a9cbe9530f01209f1c4f2b"}